'''Eco''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
It’s blade is cream white in color, along with the handle. Printed in the center of the blade is the universal symbol for recycling, which is green in color. Seen on the ricasso is a green stripe. The guard is a faded beige color.[[Category:Knives]]

